==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|anti|particle|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈæntiˌpɑɹtɪkəl/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|particle}} A [[subatomic particle]] corresponding to another [[particle]] with the same [[mass]], [[spin]] and [[mean]] [[lifetime]] but with [[charge]], [[parity]], [[strangeness]] and other [[quantum number]]s flipped in sign.

